# RecruitIQ: Recruiting Database Transformation Service

## Executive Summary

RecruitIQ transforms outdated recruiting databases into AI-powered talent intelligence platforms, unlocking hidden value in existing candidate data. Our solution leverages advanced RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) technology to enhance candidate search, implement intelligent chatbots, and provide deeper insights from recruiting data.

## Current Application Strengths

RecruitIQ has established impressive capabilities that form a solid foundation:

### 1. Advanced Candidate-Job Matching
- Sophisticated matching algorithms that consider skills, experience levels, and role compatibility
- Vector-based semantic search using Neo4j for storing embeddings
- Reranking capabilities for improved search relevance

### 2. RAG Implementation
- Well-structured retrieval system with multiple specialized vector stores
- Context compression for more relevant results
- Query classification to route different types of recruiting questions

### 3. Comprehensive Dashboard
- Multi-module frontend with dedicated views for candidates, jobs, and matching
- AI assistant integration for natural language interactions
- Resume parsing and data extraction

